# Build context ignore rules for docker/Dockerfile.bun-dev-container ONLY.
#
# BuildKit automatically uses this file instead of the repo-root .dockerignore
# when the build targets this Dockerfile (`-f docker/Dockerfile.bun-dev-container`).
# It fully replaces the root .dockerignore (no merge).
#
# This image provides a development container for Bun applications. From the context
# it copies only the devcontainer scripts in docker/devcontainer, so we ignore everything else.

# Ignore everything...
*

# ...except the files this Dockerfile copies.
!docker/devcontainer
